	<content contentuid="hbdacc699g9471g40dcgba21ge12fcf8cd7dd" version="1">When a &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="WET"&gt;Wet&lt;/LSTag&gt; target takes damage from this trident, it must succeed on a Wisdom &lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;Saving Throw&lt;/LSTag&gt; or become &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SLOW"&gt;Slowed&lt;/LSTag&gt; until the end of its next turn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The &lt;LSTag Tooltip="DifficultyClass"&gt;Difficulty Class&lt;/LSTag&gt; is based on your &lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="AMP_POTENCY_DC"&gt;Potency DC&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
